WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:03.304
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.304 --> 00:00:06.306
新建 Guide matchers / Create Guide matchers

3
00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:09.101
Host 为 127.0.0.1 / Set Host to 127.0.0.1

4
00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:12.303
添加 Method / Add Method

5
00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:15.109
Method 为 GET / Set Method to GET

6
00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:18.352
添加 Path / Add Path

7
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:21.203
填写接口 Path / Enter the endpoint Path

8
00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:24.453
添加 URL / Add URL

9
00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:27.304
填写完整演示 URL / Enter the complete example URL

10
00:00:27.304 --> 00:00:30.503
添加 Query / Add Query

11
00:00:30.503 --> 00:00:33.403
Query 为 guide=matcher-demo / Set the Query pair

12
00:00:33.403 --> 00:00:36.602
添加 Header / Add Header

13
00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:39.604
Header 为 x-guide-match=yes / Set the request Header pair

14
00:00:39.604 --> 00:00:42.904
添加 Status / Add Status

15
00:00:42.904 --> 00:00:45.762
状态范围 200 到 200 / Set range 200 to 200

16
00:00:45.762 --> 00:00:49.055
添加 MIME / Add MIME

17
00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:51.962
Response MIME 为 application/json / Set the response MIME

18
00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:55.154
响应阶段改写 Header / Select response Header editing

19
00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:58.003
填写 x-interceptor-guide / Enter the effect Header name

20
00:00:58.003 --> 00:01:00.853
填写 matcher-demo / Enter the effect value

21
00:01:00.853 --> 00:01:03.703
启用完整规则 / Enable the complete Rule

22
00:01:03.703 --> 00:01:06.655
Apply / Apply

23
00:01:06.655 --> 00:01:10.104
发送满足全部条件的 GET / Send a GET satisfying every condition

24
00:01:10.104 --> 00:01:12.954
POST 不满足 Method / A POST does not satisfy Method
